{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A retry that fails before the next poll can leave later approvals permanently rejected, while failures in the same second can reuse an earlier approval."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Persistent failures can repeatedly exhaust the call budget at the same healthy task, silently preventing its lifecycle update from being delivered."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"test","trigger":"normal","reason":"The existing suite lacks regression coverage for the reproduced F1 and F2 scenarios, with no independent runtime effect."}]}